    "body": "### Map\r\nAdded signals at spawn stations to prevent crashes when trains spawn\r\n\r\n### Timetable Changes\r\n**Both**\r\n4C01 changed start speed from 97 to 0\r\n4C01 removed arrive at Bickley\r\n1M02 changed exit to T/F Victoria via Herne Hill\r\n1M01/2 (AFK) changed to 2M01/2\r\n4C03 changed spawn to T/F Victoria via Herne Hill\r\n4C02/4 changed exit to T/F Victoria via Herne Hill\r\n3S02/4 changed exit to Slow Lines\r\n3S04 changed spawn to Slow lines\r\n**Off Peak**\r\n4C03 changed spawn from 10:02 to 10:48\r\n**Peak**\r\n6C01 changed spawn to T/F Victoria via Herne Hill\r\n6C02 changed spawn to T/F Victoria via Herne Hill\r\n4S04 changed spawn to T/F Sevenoaks via Orpington\r\n4S034 changed exit to T/F London Bridge"
